      "writtenOn": "2024-10-30T19:18:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve tried allowing the UI in settings to allow a full URL rather than only domains. The problem is that all the underlying implementation between the UI and this modified section of the code also expects a domain and not a full URL. I haven\u0027t found all places where the domain would need to be extracted from the full URL yet, but keep in mind that supporting this would require changes across different repositories",
      "parentUuid": "5780ac4d_0986eba3",
      "revId": "528d633d21988272c64b1e094d075b1ab5d2fc1b",
      "serverId": "35266860-6252-469c-a67d-185064479fc0"
