      "message": "One way it could be made to work is to add a variable to https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/NetworkStack/common/networkstackclient/src/android/net/shared/PrivateDnsConfig.java;drc\u003d517003e1168f7d0e07cac9c60e67b73f0e28dbde;l\u003d34 tracking the full URL, which would be passed down to be used only where needed. Would probably require adding a parameter to https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/DnsResolver/ResolverController.cpp;l\u003d218;drc\u003d517003e1168f7d0e07cac9c60e67b73f0e28dbde;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1\n\nNote that making changes to these may require changing \"platform APIs\" (@hide may not suffice)",
